The dates 1227-1305 are known from the biography (see work (ID:7016)) composed by his student bSam gtan bzang po (ID:4005) ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).&#13;
His name in religion was Dar ma rgyal mtshan or Chos kyi rgyal mtshan ([FZ6N88AU]: 406) - the name Chos kyi rgyal mtshan is given as his "real name" (mtshan dngos) in a homage by Rong ston ([KM47ZZDJ]: 657 and n. 62). &#13;
The majority of the colophons of his works name him "bCom ldan ral gri," a few "Rigs/Rig pa’i ral gri" or just "Ral gri." Schwabland's discussion of the variants “Rigs pa” and “Rig pa” does not come to a definite conclusion as to which is the correct spelling ([CTQMVBPR]: 2-3).&#13;
He was born as the son of a local wealthy headman, the fourth of five sons and his birth is reported to have been foretold by Śākyaśrībhadra (ID:6418) when he was invited by Ral gri's paternal uncle ([KHA9ZVGP]: 3).</note></person><person xml:id="person4294"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khyung po grags se</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཁྱུང་པོ་གྲགས་སེ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khyung po grags seng</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">khyung po</persName><birth notBefore="0874-01-01" notAfter="1050-12-31">after 874 before 1050</birth><death notBefore="0954-01-01" notAfter="1120-12-31">after 954 before 1120</death><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4294</idno></person><person xml:id="person4303"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">mda'</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">མདའ</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'da'</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jo bo 'da'</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4303</idno><note type="comment">Same person as (ID:6948), as (ID:7349)?</note></person><person xml:id="person4593"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">Anonymous</persName><persName xml:lang="bo">ཨཱནོཉམོཨུས</persName><sex value="M"/><nationality>Tibetan</nationality><idno type="APIS">4593</idno></person><person xml:id="person5611"><persName type="main" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">sthirapāla</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'bum phrag gsum pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">rgya gar pan chen</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">jo bo 'bum pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'bum</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">'bum pa</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie">brtan skyong</persName><persName type="alt" xml:lang="bo-Latn-x-wylie